<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Gold Coin 6-mth net down 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Gold Coin 6-mth net down 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     20.6    vs     26.5</p>
<p>    Net profit		  8.56   vs     10.99</p>
<p>    Turnover		  435.49   vs    374.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   12.09   vs     16.90</p>
<p>    Minorities	  gain  0.60   vs loss 0.14</p>
<p>Note - Gold Coin (Malaysia) Bhd is involved in feed and flour milling and distribution of pharmaceutical products.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
